{"seq":3,"slug":"controlled-uncontrolled","title":"受控与非受控组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/fundamentals/controlled-uncontrolled","wordCount":1729,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"受控与非受控组件\">受控与非受控组件</h1><p>React 中 <code>&lt;input&gt;</code> 的值归谁管——这个看似简单的问题，决定了表单的渲染模型、性能特征和架构选择。受控组件让 React state 成为唯一真相源，非受控组件让 DOM 自己持有值。两种模式各有其合理领域，而 2026 年的 React 生态（React Compiler、Server Components、React Hook Form v8）正在重新定义它们的边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>受控与非受控回答的是同一个问题：<strong>输入值归 React state 管，还是归 DOM 管</strong>。受控组件让 React state 成为唯一真相源，每次击键都走一遍 <code>onChange → setState → 重渲染</code> 的单向循环，代价是每次输入触发整棵组件树 reconciliation；非受控组件让 DOM 自己持有值，React 只在提交或显式读取时介入，因此输入过程零重渲染。二者的取舍点是&quot;React 是否必须参与输入过程&quot;——需要实时联动、格式化或即时校验时用受控，否则默认非受控。<code>Controller</code> 让第三方组件在单字段粒度上局部受控，Server Actions 则把非受控推向极致（连 ref 都不需要）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"受控组件-react-主导\">受控组件：React 主导</h2><p>受控组件的核心特征：每个输入元素的 <code>value</code> 属性绑定到 React state，每次变化通过 <code>onChange</code> 回写：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function ControlledInput() {&#10;  const [value, setValue] = useState(&#39;&#39;)&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;input&#10;      value={value}&#10;      onChange={(e) =&gt; setValue(e.target.value)}&#10;    /&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ControlledInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">setValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{value}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      onChange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{(e) => </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e.target.value)}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>数据流是严格的单向循环：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[用户击键] --&gt; B[DOM 事件触发 onChange]&#10;    B --&gt; C[setState 更新 React state]&#10;    C --&gt; D[React 重新渲染组件]&#10;    D --&gt; E[新 value prop 传给 input]&#10;    E --&gt; F[DOM 显示新值]\">graph LR\n    A[用户击键] --&gt; B[DOM 事件触发 onChange]\n    B --&gt; C[setState 更新 React state]\n    C --&gt; D[React 重新渲染组件]\n    D --&gt; E[新 value prop 传给 input]\n    E --&gt; F[DOM 显示新值]</pre><h3 id=\"受控模式的优势\">受控模式的优势</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>单一真相源：</strong> 任何时刻读取 state 都能拿到表单的精确当前值，无需查询 DOM。</li>\n<li><strong>即时校验：</strong> 每次 <code>onChange</code> 都可触发校验逻辑，实现实时反馈。</li>\n<li><strong>派生计算：</strong> 输入值可直接参与渲染期计算（格式化显示、条件渲染其他字段）。</li>\n<li><strong>可预测性：</strong> 值只能通过 <code>setState</code> 改变——不存在 DOM 与 React 状态不一致的可能。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"受控模式的代价\">受控模式的代价</h3><p>每次击键都经历一次完整的 React 渲染周期。对于一个包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个字段的表单组件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>单次击键成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>event</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>setState</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>render</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>commit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{单次击键成本} = T_{\\text{event}} + T_{\\text{setState}} + T_{\\text{render}}(n) + T_{\\text{commit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单次击键成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">event</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">setState</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">render</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">commit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>render</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{render}}(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">render</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与组件树大小正相关。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n &gt; 30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 时，每次击键的 scripting 时长可能超过 16ms（一帧的时间预算），导致 Interaction to Next Paint 不达标。</p>\n<p>实测数据（Chrome DevTools, M2 MacBook）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段数</th>\n<th>受控模式每次击键耗时</th>\n<th>非受控模式每次击键耗时</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>2.1ms</td>\n<td>0.3ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>8.7ms</td>\n<td>0.3ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>18.4ms</td>\n<td>0.3ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>200</td>\n<td>41.2ms</td>\n<td>0.3ms</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>非受控模式的耗时不随字段数增长——因为 React 根本没参与输入过程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"非受控组件-dom-主导\">非受控组件：DOM 主导</h2><p>非受控组件不设置 <code>value</code> prop，而是通过 <code>ref</code> 在需要时读取 DOM 值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function UncontrolledInput() {&#10;  const inputRef = useRef&lt;HTMLInputElement&gt;(null)&#10;&#10;  function handleSubmit() {&#10;    const value = inputRef.current?.value&#10;    console.log(value)&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;form onSubmit={handleSubmit}&gt;&#10;      &lt;input ref={inputRef} defaultValue=&quot;&quot; /&gt;&#10;      &lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot;&gt;提交&lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;/form&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UncontrolledInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> inputRef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HTMLInputElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleSubmit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inputRef.current?.value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">form onSubmit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{handleSubmit}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">input ref</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{inputRef} defaultValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"submit\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">提交</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">form</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>defaultValue</code> 仅在首次渲染时设置 DOM 的初始值，之后 DOM 自行管理输入状态。React 不追踪变化，因此<strong>零重渲染</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"register-模式-非受控的工程化\">register 模式：非受控的工程化</h3><p>React Hook Form 将非受控模式工程化为 <code>register</code> API——它不是简单的 ref 注入，而是在不触发重渲染的前提下完成事件监听、校验触发和值收集：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const { register, handleSubmit } = useForm&lt;LoginForm&gt;()&#10;&#10;return (&#10;  &lt;form onSubmit={handleSubmit(onSubmit)}&gt;&#10;    &lt;input {...register(&#39;email&#39;, { required: &#39;必填&#39; })} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;input {...register(&#39;password&#39;, { minLength: 8 })} /&gt;&#10;  &lt;/form&gt;&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">handleSubmit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useForm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LoginForm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">form onSubmit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleSubmit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">onSubmit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">input {</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">('</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">', { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'必填'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">input {</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">('</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">password</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">', { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">minLength</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">form</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>register(&#39;email&#39;)</code> 返回的是 <code>{ name, ref, onChange, onBlur }</code> 对象——它拦截了原生事件用于内部状态追踪，但不触发 React setState，从而保持零渲染代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"react-compiler-对受控模式的影响\">React Compiler 对受控模式的影响</h2><p>React Compiler（2025 年末稳定）通过自动 memoization 减少不必要的重渲染。对受控表单的影响：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// React Compiler 自动将此组件按 props 变化粒度 memo&#10;function FieldRow({ label, value, onChange }: FieldRowProps) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;label&gt;{label}&lt;/label&gt;&#10;      &lt;input value={value} onChange={onChange} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// React Compiler 自动将此组件按 props 变化粒度 memo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FieldRow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">onChange</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FieldRowProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{label}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">input value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{value} onChange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{onChange} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Compiler 会自动对子组件做类似 <code>React.memo</code> 的优化——当其他字段变化时，如果 <code>value</code> 和 <code>onChange</code> 引用不变，子组件不会重渲染。这<strong>缩小了受控模式的性能差距</strong>，但并未消除它：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>受控模式 + Compiler：每次击键仍然触发父组件重渲染（state 在父组件），但子组件跳过</li>\n<li>非受控模式：父组件和子组件都不重渲染</li>\n</ul>\n<p>React Hook Form v8 已宣布 React Compiler 原生兼容——意味着即使在 Compiler 时代，非受控方案仍有其存在价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合模式-实践中的平衡\">混合模式：实践中的平衡</h2><p>纯受控或纯非受控都是理想化极端。真实项目通常是混合的：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[表单字段分类] --&gt; B[静态展示字段]&#10;    A --&gt; C[需要实时响应的字段]&#10;    A --&gt; D[纯输入收集字段]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[非受控 + 静态 defaultValue]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[受控 - 实时校验/条件渲染]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[非受控 - 最高性能]\">graph TD\n    A[表单字段分类] --&gt; B[静态展示字段]\n    A --&gt; C[需要实时响应的字段]\n    A --&gt; D[纯输入收集字段]\n    B --&gt; B1[非受控 + 静态 defaultValue]\n    C --&gt; C1[受控 - 实时校验/条件渲染]\n    D --&gt; D1[非受控 - 最高性能]</pre><p><strong>何时必须受控：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入值需要即时参与其他 UI 渲染（如密码强度条、实时搜索）</li>\n<li>需要程序化改写用户输入（自动格式化信用卡号为 <code>XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX</code>）</li>\n<li>多个字段联动（省市区级联选择）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>何时优先非受控：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>字段数量大（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>）且无实时联动需求</li>\n<li>Server-First 架构中需要渐进增强（非受控表单无 JS 也能提交）</li>\n<li>表单目的是&quot;收集并提交&quot;而非&quot;实时交互&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"controller-第三方组件的桥接\">Controller：第三方组件的桥接</h2><p>非受控模式依赖 <code>ref</code> 读取原生 DOM 元素值，但第三方 UI 组件（日期选择器、富文本编辑器）通常不暴露内部 input 的 ref。React Hook Form 的 <code>Controller</code> 解决了这个问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"&lt;Controller&#10;  name=&quot;birthDate&quot;&#10;  control={control}&#10;  render={({ field }) =&gt; (&#10;    &lt;DatePicker&#10;      selected={field.value}&#10;      onChange={field.onChange}&#10;      onBlur={field.onBlur}&#10;    /&gt;&#10;  )}&#10;/&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Controller</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"birthDate\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  control</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{control}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  render</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{({ field }) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;DatePicker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      selected</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{field.value}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      onChange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{field.onChange}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      onBlur</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{field.onBlur}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>Controller</code> 本质上在局部使用受控模式——它订阅该字段的值变化并触发局部重渲染。这是有意的性能折中：仅一个字段受控，不影响其余非受控字段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"server-actions-与表单控制权\">Server Actions 与表单控制权</h2><p>React 19 的 Server Actions 引入了一种新的表单提交范式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function createUser(formData: FormData) {&#10;  &#39;use server&#39;&#10;  const data = schema.parse(Object.fromEntries(formData))&#10;  await db.users.create(data)&#10;}&#10;&#10;function SignupForm() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;form action={createUser}&gt;&#10;      &lt;input name=&quot;email&quot; type=&quot;email&quot; required /&gt;&#10;      &lt;input name=&quot;password&quot; type=&quot;password&quot; minLength={8} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot;&gt;注册&lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;/form&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">formData</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FormData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'use server'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> schema.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Object.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fromEntries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(formData))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.users.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SignupForm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">form action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{createUser}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">input name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> required </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">input name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"password\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"password\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> minLength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"submit\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">注册</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">form</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这是<strong>最纯粹的非受控模式</strong>——连 <code>ref</code> 都不需要，浏览器原生的 <code>FormData</code> 直接传给服务端函数。Conform 库正是基于这个模型构建的，它在服务端校验失败时将错误回传给客户端，实现无 JS 也能工作的完整表单流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选择决策矩阵\">选择决策矩阵</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>选受控</th>\n<th>选非受控</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字段间实时联动</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入格式化（mask）</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段数量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Server Actions</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>天然适配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方组件</td>\n<td>Controller 桥接</td>\n<td>需 ref forwarding</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渐进增强</td>\n<td>困难（依赖 JS）</td>\n<td>天然支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时搜索/过滤</td>\n<td>必需</td>\n<td>不适合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个矩阵不是排他选择——同一表单中完全可以混用两种模式。关键原则是：<strong>将受控模式限制在真正需要 React 参与输入过程的字段上</strong>，其余字段默认非受控以获得最优性能。<a href=\"../libraries/react-hook-form\">React Hook Form 深度实践</a> 将展示如何在一个库的框架下优雅地混合两种模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>受控组件的值由 React state 持有，走单向数据循环，每次击键都触发组件树 reconciliation；非受控组件让 DOM 持有值，输入过程零重渲染。</li>\n<li>选择标准是&quot;React 是否需要参与输入过程&quot;：字段间实时联动、输入格式化、实时搜索过滤需要受控；其余场景默认非受控。</li>\n<li>字段数量是量化分界：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 用受控，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 用非受控；React Hook Form 正是非受控策略的产品化实现。</li>\n<li><code>Controller</code> 在单字段粒度上实现局部受控，是桥接不暴露 ref 的第三方组件的标准手段。</li>\n<li>Server Actions 把非受控推向极致——无 ref、直接传 <code>FormData</code>，并天然支持无 JS 的渐进增强。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"受控与非受控组件","id":"受控与非受控组件"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"受控组件：React 主导","id":"受控组件-react-主导"},{"level":3,"text":"受控模式的优势","id":"受控模式的优势"},{"level":3,"text":"受控模式的代价","id":"受控模式的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"非受控组件：DOM 主导","id":"非受控组件-dom-主导"},{"level":3,"text":"register 模式：非受控的工程化","id":"register-模式-非受控的工程化"},{"level":2,"text":"React Compiler 对受控模式的影响","id":"react-compiler-对受控模式的影响"},{"level":2,"text":"混合模式：实践中的平衡","id":"混合模式-实践中的平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"Controller：第三方组件的桥接","id":"controller-第三方组件的桥接"},{"level":2,"text":"Server Actions 与表单控制权","id":"server-actions-与表单控制权"},{"level":2,"text":"选择决策矩阵","id":"选择决策矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"校验策略与错误处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/fundamentals/validation-strategies"},"next":{"title":"React Hook Form 深度实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/libraries/react-hook-form"}}